  "full_text": "So, why don't we start praying for the souls of the poor Lennox Atheist and their Gaylord leader, Mr. Torvalds. Let's pray for the souls of them. And they'll be our first... I think, let's start there. You know, I had a car, right? A van. And it got impounded. It was in a Mexican neighborhood and all the circuitry was haywire. Then I bought a computer, not a computer, I bought a used camera. I'm not kidding, the ROM was haywire. Just recently I'm just trying to use this laptop and experiencing some network difficulties. It's a little premature. I'm the first one to know that that's... little paranoid but on the car was seriously haywire like the lights are like locking on and draining the battery and crazy-ass shit like the CIA really you know most people that's bullshit but no um anyway so let's pray for the souls of the Linux atheist and their Gaylord leader mr. Torvalds so",
